<Layout title="Cookie Policy" description="Cookie Policy for Anime Story Films.">
  <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
  <p><em>Last updated: 19 November 2026.</em></p>
  <p>
    This website uses cookies — small text files stored in your
    browser — to make the website work and to understand how it is
    used.
  </p>

  <h2>What cookies we use</h2>
  <p>
    We use only basic, essential cookies needed for the website to
    function, and, where enabled, simple analytics cookies that tell
    us which pages are visited. These cookies do not identify you
    personally.
  </p>

  <h2>Advertising cookies (Google AdSense)</h2>
  <p>
    If advertising is shown on this website, it may be served by
    Google AdSense. Google and its partners may use cookies to show
    you ads based on your visits to this and other websites. Google's
    use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve
    ads to you based on your browsing. You can opt out of
    personalised advertising by visiting Google's Ads Settings at
    <a href="https://adssettings.google.com/">adssettings.google.com</a>,
    or by visiting
    <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/">www.aboutads.info/choices</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>How to refuse cookies</h2>
  <p>
    You can refuse or delete cookies in your browser settings. Most
    browsers let you block all cookies, block third-party cookies
    only, or delete cookies when you close the browser. Please note
    that blocking cookies may affect how some parts of the website
    work — for example, embedded videos may not play.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about this policy? Contact us at
    <a href="mailto:animestory2009@gmail.com">animestory2009@gmail.com</a>
    or see our <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a>.
  </p>
</Layout>
